## What was broken (#629)

A fresh re-run of setup — `START-HERE.bat --yes --family qwen --model IQ3_S --gpus 0,1 --context 131072`, or answering the setup questions again to change the context length or the size — regenerated `strata-<model>.json` from scratch and quietly dropped everything the generator does not write itself:

